# Hovel Hurler (a 6/7): "This creature enters with two -1/-1 counters on it." and "{R/W}{R/W}, Remove a counter from this creature:
# Another target creature you control gets +1/+0 and gains flying until end of turn. Activate only as a sorcery." Turn 1 Bot1 casts
# it (a 4/5) off a Black Lotus and two Moxen. Turns 3 and 5 it pays {R/W}{R/W} and a counter each time to give its Elvish Mystic
# +1/+0 and flying until end of turn (a 2/1 flyer that turn, a 1/1 again the next), growing to 5/6 and then 6/7. It cannot target itself.

